{"ref":"BDB, אֲנָחָה","hw":"אֲנָחָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנָחָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. sighing, groaning</strong> (poet. & late);—abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:11\" href=\"/Psalms.31.11\">ψ 31:11</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְחָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:24\" href=\"/Job.3.24\">Jb 3:24</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְחָתָהֿ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.2\">Is 21:2</a> (sf. with Raphe). Pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְחֹתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.22\">La 1:22</a>;—<em>sighing, groaning</em>, in distress, physical or mental <a data-ref=\"Job 3:24\" href=\"/Job.3.24\">Jb 3:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאָגָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 23:2\" href=\"/Job.23.2\">23:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחַ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:7\" href=\"/Psalms.6.7\">ψ 6:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 38:10\" href=\"/Psalms.38.10\">38:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּאֲוָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.2\">Is 21:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.22\">La 1:22</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָגוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:11\" href=\"/Psalms.31.11\">ψ 31:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.10\">Is 35:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.11\">51:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 45:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.45.3\">Je 45:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:6\" href=\"/Psalms.102.6\">ψ 102:6</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲנַחְנוּ","prev":"BDB, אָנַח"}